              "annotations": [],
              "text": "### Factual Summary\n\n**Basic Streaming Session (Tier: Basic)**\n*   **Status:** Stream-completed.\n*   **Funding:** A deposit of **10,000 raw units (0.01 USDC)** was successfully escrowed to stream address `0x35f5F69A68D703d70e661b5a0fDe282B3c4dfA09` (Stream ID: 8). The funding transaction hash is `0xab29300d79a611e238eb5fe0d855c3f69c682f5380c8ea9a63a798ea374328f7`.\n*   **Operation:** The session demonstrated local CRE OPEN and CONTINUE states. The client successfully reused the single funded stream for **10 real requests** across three batches without additional payment transactions (nonces remained static during request batches).\n*   **Outage & Closure:** A demo outage was injected, triggering a CLOSE checkpoint. The wallet cancelled the stream, resulting in a settlement transaction (`0xe9793498fab33d7a5e964da9bca0f41ac7b576285d1a6d47a670fa83d4e78a96`).\n*   **Financial Outcome:**\n    *   **Earned:** 1,200 raw units (0.0012 USDC) accrued based on time elapsed.\n    *   **Refunded:** 8,800 raw units (0.0088 USDC) returned to the sender as unused deposit.\n    *   The full deposit was not paid to the recipient; only the time-accrued portion was settled.\n\n**Premium Streaming Session (Tier: Premium)**\n*   **Status:** Denied.\n*   **Reason:** The requested amount of **200,000 raw units (0.2 USDC)** exceeded the policy cap of **100,000 raw units (0.1 USDC)**.\n*   **Transaction:** No transaction was signed or executed; agent and recipient balances remained unchanged.\n\nNo DON or onchain CRE authorization was claimed or required for these test token operations.",
